uri "http://kdl.ge.com/AM-CDM-system" alias AM-CDM-system version "$Revision:$ Last modified on   $Date:$".

import "http://kdl.ge.com/AM-CDM-process".

System (note "Collection of interconnected components that are organized and interact to realize one or more functions.") is a class,
	described by systemID (note "Unique identifier of the system.") with a single value of type string,
	described by systemName (note "Name of the system.") with a single value of type string,
	described by systemPurchaseDate (note "Purchase date of the system.") with a single value of type dateTime,
	described by systemOwner (note "Owning organization of the system.") with a single value of type Organization,
	described by systemLocation (note "Location where the system is installed.") with a single value of type Address,
	described by systemSpecification (note "Information about the system that is specified by the system manufacturer.") with a single value of type SystemSpecification,
	described by systemProcessHistory (note "Ordered series of processes that have occurred to the system.") with a single value of type ProcessHistory,
	described by systemComponents (note "Other systems that have been assembled and integrated to constitiute the system.") with values of type System,
	described by systemCapability (note "Capabilities of the system.") with a single value of type systemCapability.

SystemSpecification (note "Information about the system that is specified by the system manufacturer.") is a class,
	described by systemSerialNumber (note "Serial number of the system defined by the manufacturer.") with a single value of type string,
	described by systemModel (note "Model name of a machine defined by the system manufacturer.") with a single value of type string,
	described by systemManufacturer (note "Manufacturer of the system.") with a single value of type Organization,
	described by systemSpecElectricVoltage (note "Voltage for the system's electrical connection.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by systemSpecPowerIntensity (note "Current intensity required to power the system.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by systemSpecPowerFrequency (note "Power frequency for the electrical connection of the system.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by systemSoftware (note "Computer programs required for operation of the system.") with values of type Software.

AMSystem (note "System that is capable of additive manufacturing.") is a type of System.

systemSpecification of AMSystem only has values of type AMSystemSpecification.
systemCapability of AMSystem only has values of type AMSystemCapability.
 
AMSystemSpecification (note "Specifications that are unique to the additive manufacturing system.") is a type of SystemSpecification,
	described by amSystemHazmatRequirements (note "Information specifying hazardous material requirements of the additive manufacturing system.") with a single value of type string.

Sensor (note "System that observes an object or a process and collects data about the object or process.") is a type of System,
	described by sensorSpecification (note "Specification that is unique to a sensor.") with a single value of type SensorSpecification.

SensorSpecification (note "Specification that is unique to a sensor.") is a type of SystemSpecification,
	described by samplingRateMin (note "Minimum rate at which the sensor is able to sample data at.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by samplingRateMax (note "Maximum rate at which the sensor is able to sample data at.") with a single value of type Quantity.

BuildChamber (note "Enclosed location within an additive manufacturing system where the parts are fabricated.") is a type of System,
	described by buildChamberEnvironmentalControl (note "Build chamber characteristic that specifies the capability to monitor or regulate environmental conditions within the build chamber.") with a single value of type BuildEnvironmentalControl,
	described by buildChamberVolume (note "Total usable volume available in the additive manufacturing system for building parts.") with a single value of type BuildVolume.

Laser (note "A system that is capable of producing a laser beam.") is a type of System,
	described by laserSpecification (note "Specification that is unique to a laser.") with a single value of type laserSpecification,
	described by laserLaserBeamProfile (note "Measured cross-sectional intensity profile of a laser beam.") with a single value of type Document.

laserSpecification (note "A specification that is unique to a laser.") is a type of SystemSpecification,
	// removed because an additive manufacturingsystem can have multiple laser systems associated with it. A single laser can not have a number of lasers. The number of lasers would have to be deduced by the number of laser systems an additive manufacturingsystem has. we could group the energy systems together to capture metadata in the future. described by laserNumberOfLasers (note "The number of laser beams the laser is intentionally designed to produce by the laser manufacturer.") with a single value of type int,
	described by laserModeOfLaserOperation (note "Characteristic of a laser that specifies the temporal pattern by which laser energy is emitted.") with a single value of type string,
	described by laserMaxLaserPower (note "Maximum power output that the laser is able to emmit, as specified by the laser manufacturer.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by laserMinLaserPower (note "Minimum power output that the laser is able to emmit, as specified by the laser manufacturer.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by laserRatedWaveLength (note "Wavelength that the laser operates at as specificed by the laser manufacturer.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by laserBeamShape (note "Shape of the laser beam that was designed by the laser manufacturer. This does not account for any additional optics that may modify the laser beam shape.") with a single value of type string,
	described by laserMaxBeamSpotSize (note "Maximum cross-sectional size of the laser beam as specificed by the laser manufacturer. This does not account for any additional optics that may modify the spot size.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by laserMinBeamSpotSize (note "Minimum cross-sectional size of the laser beam as specificed by the laser manufacturer. This does not account for any additional optics that may modify the spot size.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by laserFocusCorrectionType (note "Optical component or approach used to maintain the desired laser beam focus during operation.") with a single value of type string.

Recoater (note "System which spreads powder accross a surface.") is a type of System.

systemSpecification of Recoater only has values of type RecoaterSpecification.

RecoaterSpecification (note "Specification that is unique to a recoater.") is a type of SystemSpecification,
	described by recoaterMaximumSpeed (note "Maximum speed at which the recoater can transverse at.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by recoaterMaxUsesAllowed (note "Maximum number of builds that a recoater is allowed to participate in.") with a single value of type integer,
	described by recoatingSurfaceMaterialType (note "Material that the recoating surface is made of.") with a single value of type MaterialType,
	described by recoatingSurfaceMaterialSpecification (note "Specifications that are unique to the recoating surface material.") with a single value of type Document.

GalvoScanner (note "System that is used to manipulate the position of something.") is a type of System.

systemSpecification of GalvoScanner only has values of type GalvoScannerSpecification.

GalvoScannerSpecification (note "Specification that is unique to a galvo scanner.")is a type of SystemSpecification,
	described by galvoScannerMaxScanAngleX (note "Maximum angle in the X direction, relative to the galvo scanner origin, that the galvo scanner is capable of rotating to.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by galvoScannerMaxScanAngleY (note "Maximum angle in the Y direction, relative to the galvo scanner origin, that the galvo scanner is capable of rotating to..") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by galvoScannerRepeatability (note "Maximum angle in the Z direction, relative to the galvo scanner origin, that the galvo scanner is capable of rotating to..") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by galvoScannerMaxScanSpeed (note "Maximum taversal speed that the galvo scanner is capable of achieving.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by galvoScannerOrigin (note "Location of the origin of the galvo scanner within the scan area, typically where the galvanometer motors recieve a neutral control signal.") with a single value of type CartesianCoordinate,
	described by galvoScannerType (note "Information that classifies a galvo scanner according to its scanning configuration and beam-steering capabilities.") with a single value of type string.

Camera (note "System that is capable of capturing or recording visual images of a subject.") is a type of Sensor.

systemSpecification of Camera only has values of type CameraSpecification.

CameraSpecification (note "Specification that is unique to a camera.") is a type of SensorSpecification,
	described by cameraImageWidth (note "Camera image width in pixel.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by cameraBitDepth (note "Bit depth of pixel values.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by cameraImageHeight (note "Camera image height in pixel.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by cameraCenter (note "Location of the center position of a camera.") with a single value of type CartesianCoordinate,
	described by cameraOpticalFilterBandwidth (note "Bandwidth of a camera's filter bandwidth.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by cameraDetectorPitchSize (note "Camera detection pitch size.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by cameraDigitalMagnification (note "Magnification factor setting of a camera.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by cameraLensOpticalMagnification (note "Ratio of the size of an image formed by a camera lens to the size of the corresponding object.") with a single value of type float,
	described by cameraMinShutterSpeed (note "Shortest exposure duration that a camera is capable of using to acquire an image.") with a single value of type Quantity.

Lens (note "Assembly of shaped glass or plastic elements designed to collect, bend, and focus incoming light rays onto a single plane.") is a type of Sensor.

systemSpecification of Lens only has values of type LensSpecification.

LensSpecification (note "Specification that is unique to a lens.") is a type of SensorSpecification,
	described by lensMaxAperture (note "Lens characteristic that specifies the largest aperture through which light can pass during image formation.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by lensFilter (note "Type of filter used in conjunction with a lens to modify the light that passes through it.")with a single value of type string.

Photodiode (note "Semiconductor light sensor that converts light energy (photons) directly into an electrical current or voltage.") is a type of Sensor.

systemSpecification of Photodiode only has values of type PhotodiodeSpecification.

PhotodiodeSpecification (note "Specification that is unique to a photodiode.") is a type of SensorSpecification,
	described by photodiodeOpticalFilterBandwidth (note "Optical filter characteristic that specifies the range of wavelengths transmitted to a photodiode.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by photodiodeBitDepth (note "Measurement characteristic that specifies the number of bits used to represent a measured signal value.") with a single value of type Quantity.

Pyrometer (note "Non-contact temperature measurement system that operates by detecting and measuring radiation emitted from an object.") is a type of Sensor.

systemSpecification of Pyrometer only has values of type PyrometerSpecification.

PyrometerSpecification (note "Specification that is unique to a pyrometer.") is a type of SensorSpecification,
	described by pyrometerOpticalFilterBandwidth1 (note "First bandwidth of the pyrometers optical filter") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by pyrometerOpticalFilterBandwidth2 (note "Second bandwidth of the pyrometers optical filter.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by pyrometerBitDepth (note "Measurement characteristic that specifies the number of bits used to represent a measured temperature value") with a single value of type Quantity.

LaserPowderBedFusionSystem (note "Additive Manufacturing system capable of building parts through the laser powder bed fusion process.") is a type of AMSystem.

ElectronBeamPowderBedFusionSystem (note "Additive Manufacturing system capable of building parts through the electron beam powder bed fusion process.") is a type of AMSystem.

DirectedEnergyDepositionSystem (note "Additive Manufacturing system capable of building parts through the directed energy deposition process.") is a type of AMSystem.

BinderJetSystem (note "Additive Manufacturing system capable of building parts through the binder jet process.") is a type of AMSystem.

BuildEnvironmentalControl (note "Environment control of the build chamber on its temperature, pressure, humidity and oxygen level, for optimal quality of AM material transformation.") is a class,
	described by buildEnvironmentControlShieldingGasType (note "Type of shielding gas used in the build environmental control system.") with a single value of type string,
	described by buildEnvironmentControlMaximumPreheatingTemperature (note "Maximum temperature that the build environmental control is capable of preheating to.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by buildEnvironmentControlGasFlowNozzleType (note "Type of gas flow nozzle utilized by the build environmental control.") with a single value of type string,
	described by buildEnvironmentControlShieldingDeviceType (note "Type of shielding device used by the build environmental control.") with a single value of type string.

BuildVolume (note "Total usable volume available as part of the additive manufacturing system.") is a class,
	described by buildVolumeShape (note "Shape of the build volume.") with a single value of type string,
	described by buildVolumeDimension (note "Width, Depth, Height of a build volume.") with a single value of type CartesianCoordinate,
	described by buildVolumeDiameter (note "Diameter of a building volume if of cylinder type.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by buildVolumeMachineOrigin (note "Origin X, Y, and Z position as defined by machine manufacturer relative to build volume center.") with a single value of type CartesianCoordinate,
	described by buildVolumeTotalBuildVolume (note "Total usable volume available in the additive manufacturing system.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by buildVolumeMachineLastCleanoutDate (note "Date when the build volume was last cleaned.") with a single value of type dateTime.

SystemCapability (note "Capabilities or limitations of a system, which may be provided by the system manufacturer or vendor.") is a class

AMSystemCapability (note "Capabilities of an additive manufacturing system, which may be provided by the system manufacturer or vendor.") is a class,
	described by systemCapabilityProcessableRawMaterial (note "Processable raw material list of an additive manufacturing system.") with values of type MaterialType,
	described by systemCapabilityMaximumBuildRate (note "Maximum build rate (reported in volume or mass per unit of time) that the additive manufacturing system is capable of operating at.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by systemCapabilityMinimumLayerThickness (note "Smallest layer thickness that the additive manufacturing system is capable of producing.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by systemCapabilityMaximumLayerThickness (note "Maximum layer thickness that the additive manufacturing system is capable of producing.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by systemCapabilityMinimumOxygenLevel (note "Minimum level of oxygen that the additive manufacturing system is capable of operating at.") with a single value of type Quantity,
	described by systemCapabilityMinimumMoistureLevel (note "Minimum level of moisture that the additive manufacturing system is capable of operating at.") with a single value of type Quantity.

SystemQualificationEvent (note "Event that a system undergoes to evaluate whether or not it can be qualified to some standard.") is a type of ProcessStep,
	described by processEventData (note "Data associated with a process event that record observations, measurements, states, or outcomes pertaining to that event") with a single value of type SystemQualificationEventData.

SystemQualificationEventData (note "Data that is generated as a result of a system qualification event.") is a type of ProcessStepData,
	described by systemQualDataPassFail (note "Pass / fail result of a system qualification event.") with a single value of type string,
	described by systemQualDataResults (note "Certification capturing the basic calibration and test build(s) performed after installation of machine; aka, suite acceptance report, tied to a machine serial number.") with a single value of type string.

InstallationQualification (note "Qualification process involved in the installation of an additive manufacturing system.") is a type of SystemQualificationEvent.

OperationalQualification (note "Qualificaiton process involved in the operationalization of an additive manufacturing system, often to evaluate and validate the performance of a particular additive manufacturingSystem for a particular material type.") is a type of SystemQualificationEvent.

PerformanceQualification (note "Qualification process involved in the evaluation of an additive manufacturing system's capability to meet performance requirements for a partiular part.") is a type of SystemQualificationEvent.

MaintenanceEvent is a (note "Maintenance process performed on a system.") type of PlannedProcessStep,
	described by processEventData (note "Process monitoring data or real-time control information about the process event.") with a single value of type MaintenanceEventData.

MaintenanceEventData (note "Data that is associated with a Maintenance Event.") is a type of ProcessStepData,
	described by maintenanceDataReport (note "Technical report from the maintenance event.") with a single value of type Document.

SystemCalibration (note "Type of maintenance event that involves the process of determining and, when necessary, adjusting the relationship between a system's outputs and known reference values to achieve a specified level of measurement accuracy.") is a type of MaintenanceEvent.

processEventData of SystemCalibration only has values of type SystemCalibrationData.

SystemCalibrationData (note "Data associated with the calibration of a system.") is a type of ProcessStepData,
	described by calibrationPassFail (note "Pass / fail result of a system calibration.") with a single value of type string,
	described by calibrationDataResults (note "Results of the equipment calibration (files, etc.).") with a single value of type Document.

Software (note "Collection of computer-readable instructions and associated data that direct the operation of a system.") is a class,
	described by softwareName (note "Supplier name of the software.") with a single value of type string,
	described by softwareID (note "Unique identifier of the software.") with a single value of type string,
	described by softwareVendor (note "Vendor of the software.") with a single value of type Organization,
	described by softwareVersion (note "Version number of the software.") with a single value of type string,
	described by softwareConfigurationSettingsFile (note "File representing the specific software settings used.") with a single value of type Document,
	described by softwareFileType (note "File type used by the software (for automated processing).") with a single value of type string.

HTSystem (note "System capable of performing a Heat Treatment.") is a type of System.
HIPSystem (note "System capable of performing Hot Isostatic Pressing.") is a type of System.
PartExtractionSystem (note "System capable of part extraction.") is a type of System.
